and drinks,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_11","text":"and gossip all night long about all sorts of things.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_12","text":"After we did that,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_13","text":"my heart got all warm and fuzzy, you know?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_14","text":">///<","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_15","text":"It was so nice, hehe.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_16","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_16","text":"I have to say, I'm a little upset.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_17","text":"Huh?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_18","text":"Eh?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_19","text":"What's wrong, Commander?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_20","text":"Why would you be upset?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_21","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_21","text":"You and I haven't had a pajama party yet.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_22","text":"Ah!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_23","text":"Now that I think about it, you're right!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_24","text":"I haven't done that with you yet, Commander!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_25","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_25","text":"Maybe I wasn't that close of a friend to you after all.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_26","text":"No!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_27","text":"That's not it!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_28","text":"Not at all!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_29","text":"Um...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_30","text":"Uh...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_31","text":"The idea of having a pajama party","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_32","text":"and hanging out with you in pajamas","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_33","text":"makes me feel kind of self-conscious... T_T","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_34","text":"Uh, ahh! >///<","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_35","text":"But still, if we're really close friends, I guess it's okay, right?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_36","text":"Could you give me just a moment, Commander?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_37","text":"I'll get ready right away!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_38","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_38","text":"?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_39","text":"Let's do it!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_40","text":"Let's have a pajama party!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_41","text":"Just give me a few minutes.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti_t","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_42","text":"I'll buy you a set of PJs and bring them over right away.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_43","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_43","text":"No, Vesti, wait!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_44","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_44","text":"I was just joking,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_45","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_45","text":"really!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_46","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_46","text":"But there's no reply from Vesti.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_47","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_vesti_tactical_02_47","text":"... Seems like she'll be here soon, so I'll wait for her.","jump":null}],"chat":true}